1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,980
M: Have we made arrangements to reschedule last week's outdoor concert which was canceled due to rain?

2
00:00:05,460 --> 00:00:11,140
W: I was informed by Travis Donovan that it will be held next Tuesday at 6:00 in the evening.

3
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:13,040
M: Are you positive?

4
00:00:13,040 --> 00:00:17,465
I want to print some posters to advertise it and don't want to get the date wrong.

5
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:23,520
W: Why don't you call Mr. Donovan at extension 584 and confirm it with him?

6
00:00:23,760 --> 00:00:24,600
M: Thanks for the number.

7
00:00:25,220 --> 00:00:28,980
But I have to wait to call him because I just saw him leave the office with a client.

8
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:32,910
W: Oh, I wasn't aware he had any meetings scheduled for today.
